<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Efesienji</para>
  <para style="toc1">Epistola Cãtrã Efesienji</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efesienji</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ef</para>
  <para style="mt1">Epistola Cãtrã Efesienji</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Mini Pavlu, apostul al Hristolu Isus prit vrearea a Dumnidzãlui, ma lji scriu a popului a Dumnidzãlui cai easti tu Efes sh-pistipseashti tu Hristolu Isus:<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Har sh-pace s-avets di la Dumnidzãlu, Tatãl a nostru sh-di la Domnul Isus Hristos.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ghinicuvintãrili a Dumnidzãlui tu Hristolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Alãvdat s-hibã Dumnidzãlu sh-Tatãl a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos. Elu nã ari ghinicuvintat prit Hristolu tu locurili tsereshti cu cathi ghinicuvintari sufliteascã. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Dumnidzãlu nã aleapsi nãinti di thimiljiusirea a lumiljei tu nãsu tra s-him sãmtsã sh-fãrã cusuri nãintea a lui, tu vrearea a lui. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Elu nã arãdãpsi tra s-himã hiljashtsrã prit Isus Hristos cu arsirea sh-vrearea a lui, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />tsi noi s-lu alãvdãm trã harul a lui mãrit tsi nã durusi tu vreari trã Hiljilu a lui. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Elu nã arãscumpãrã prit sãndzili a lui sh-nã li ljirtã amãrtiili dupã avearili a harului a lui. <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Aestu har elu nã lu ari dat cu artirsiri, cu frunimeatsã sh-cu mintimenilji. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Elu nã featsi cunuscut mistiryiul a vreariljei a lui dupã arsirea a lui, tsi elu u-avea arãdãpsitã tu Hristolu. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Aestu mistiryiu elu va lu mplinea tu chirolu tsi prindea, tra s-li adunã tuti lucrili sum Hristolu, cum atseali tsi suntu tu tseruri sh-atseali tsi suntu pri loc. <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Tu Hristolu noi nã aleapsim, tra s-nã arãdãpsim dupã scupolu atsilui tsi lã fatsi itsido dupã urnimia a vreariljei a lui. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Ashãtsi noi tsi avem nãdãit ma nãinti tu Hristolu, s-adutsem alãvdarea a mãririljei a lui. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Tutashã, sh-voi earat mpriunat tu Hristolu cãndu avdzãtã zborlu a alihiljei, evanghelu a ascãpariljei a voastrã. Cãndu voi pistipsit, vã vulusit cu Duhlu Sãmtu, cai eara tãxit. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Aestu Duh easti cãpara a mushtiniriljei a noastrã, trã arãscumpãrarea atsilor cai suntu a Dumnidzãlui sh-trã alãvdarea a mãririljei a lui.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rugãciuni trã Frunimeatsã sh-Discupiriri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Trã aestã, di cãndu avdzãi di pistea a voastrã tu Domnul Isus sh-ti vrearea a voastrã tsi avets trã tut populu a Dumnidzãlui, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />nu pãpsescu ti hãristisiri Dumnidzãlu trã voi, aducãnda-vã aminti tu rugãciunjili a meali, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />tsi Dumnidzãlu a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos, Tatãl a mãririljei, s-vã da a voauã Duhlu a frunimeatsiljei sh-a discupiririljei tra s-putets s-lu cunushtets atsel ma ghini. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Mi rog s-vã lunjineadzã ocljilji a ininjilor a voastri, tra s-cunushtets nãdia trã cai vã acljimã, s-cunushtets avearea a mushtiniriljei alãvdatã trã populu a Dumnidzãlui, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />sh-cãt mari easti putearea a lui cãtrã noi tsi pistipsim tu nãsu. Aestã fuchii easti idyia puteari a Dumnidzãlui tsi lucreadzã tu noi. <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />Easti aestã puteari cu cai elu nyie Hristolu dit mortsã sh-lu bãgã tu nandreapta a thronlui a lui tu locurili tsereshti, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />lu bãgã pristi cathi stãpuiri sh-puteari, pristi cathi fuchii sh-domnilji sh-pristi cathi numã tsi s-cunoashti nu mash tu aestã etã, ma sh-tu atsea tsi va yinã. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Dumnidzãlu sumbãgã itsido sum cicioarili a Hristolui sh-lu bãgã ca cap pristi tuti la bisearicã. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Bisearica easti truplu a Hristolui, mplinirea a lui tsi mplineashti itsido la tuti.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ascãparea prit Har</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Sh-voi cu tutã cã earats mortsã tu cãlcãrili sh-amãrtiili a voastri, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />la cai voi imnatã dupã cãljurili a lumiljei aishtei sh-vã sumbãgat a printslui a amirãriljei a aerãljei, a duhlui tsi tora lucreadzã tu atselji nipistimenji. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Sh-noi vãrãoarã bãnam ca elji, njidzeam dupã orixili a truplui, fãtseam tsi vrea truplu sh-mintea a noastrã. Noi ca atselji altsãlji earam di naturã cilimenji a nãrirãljei al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ma Dumnidzãlu, hinda avut tu njilã, trã itia atsea marea a vreariljei a lui cu cai nã vru, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />sh-cãtse noi earam mortsã tu amãrtiili a noastri, nã nyie deadun cu Hristolu, sh-prit harul hits ascãpats. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Dumnidzãlu nã nyie deadun cu nãsu sh-nã apunã cu nãsu tu locurili tsereshti tu Hristolu Isus, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />cu nãeti tra si aspunã tu eta tsi yini ayishtearea atsea multa a harului a lui, tu bunãtatea a lui cãtrã noi tu Hristolu Isus. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Cã cu harul hits ascãpats prit pistea sh-aestã nu yini di la voi, ma easti doara a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Voi nu vã ascãpat prit faptili a voastri sh-ashãtsi vãrã s-nu si s-alavdã. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Cã noi him fãptura a Dumnidzãlui, faptã tu Hristolu Isus trã fãtseari fapti buni, tsi Dumnidzãlu li arãdãpsi di ma nãinti tsi noi s-imnãm cu eali.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pãngãnji sh-Iudei, un Trup tu Hristolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Trã atsea, adutsets-vã aminti cã voi vãrãoarã earats pãngãnji di tu amintari sh-acljimats nianvãrliga-tãljeats di atselji tsi s-acljeamã anvãrliga-tãljeats. Elji suntu tãljeats tu trup di mãna a omlui. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Adutsets aminti cã tu atsel chiro voi earats dispãrtsãt di Hristolu, scoasã nafoarã di populu al Israel, earats xenji trã pisti-ligãtura a tãxiriljei, fãrã nãdii sh-fãrã Dumnidzã tu lumea aestã. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ma tora tu Hristolu Isus voi tsi unãoarã earats diparti, vã au aprucheat prit sãndzili a Hristolui. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Cã Hristolu easti pacea a noastrã. Elu di pãngãnjlji sh-di Iudeilji featsi un singur popul, sh-tu truplu a lui asparsi murul tsi mpãrtsa sh-lã fãtsea neamitsi. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Elu anulã legea cu ordinli sh-reguli, cu nãeti tsi di doi oaminji s-adarã un om nou singur, fãcãnda pace namisa di nãshi, <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />li puitui tu un trup singur atselji cu Dumnidzãlu prit crutsea, sh-asparsi dushmãniljea namisa di elji. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Elu vini sh-vã dimãndã evanghelu a paciljei cum a voauã tsi earat diparti di Dumnidzãlu ashãtsi sh-atsilor tsi eara aproapi di nãsu. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Cã, prit Hristolu, cum voi pãngãnjlji, ashãtsi sh-noi Iudeilji, avem intrari la Tatãl prit singurlu Duh. <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Trã atsea, voi nu hits ma xenji sh-vinits, ma hits cãsãbunji deadun cu populu a Dumnidzãlui sh-membri a casãljei a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Voi hits adrat pri timeljiu a apostuljilor sh-a prufitsilor, cu Hristolu Isus ca cheatra a chiusheiljei. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Tu Hristolu tutã casa s-mpriuneadzã shi creashti tra s-hibã templu sãmtu tu Domnul. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Prit nãsu sh-voi tuts deadun cu altsãlji hits adrat ca casa iu bãneadzã Dumnidzãlu tu Duhlu a lui.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mistiryiul a Acljimariljei a Pãngãnjilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Trã atsea mini, Pavlu, hãpsãnitul al Hristos Isus trã itia a voastrã, pãngãnji, <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />sigurã cã avets avdzãt di nicuchiripsirea a harului al Dumnidzãu tsi nji-eara dat a njia trã voi, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />cã prit un discupiriri nji si featsi cunuscut a njia mistiryiul, ashãtsi cum scriai ma nãinti cu putsãni zboari. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Cãndu s-li cãntats atseali, voi va putets s-achicãsits cãt ghini u cunoscu mistiryiul a Hristolui. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Aestu mistiryiu nu s-featsi cunuscut a oaminjlor di etili atseali tricuti, ma tora prit Duh si discupri aestã a apostuljilor sh-a prufitsilor a lui sãmtsã, <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />tsi prit evanghelu pãngãnjlji s-hibã deadun mushtinitori, deadun mãdulari tu un trup sh-urtac deadun tu tãxirea a Hristolui Isus. <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Mini mi feciu huzmichear a aishtui evanghelu prit doara a harului al Dumnidzãu tsi nji si deadi a njia prit lucrarea a puteariljei a lui.<verse eid="EPH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Huzmitipsirea Apostolicã al Pavlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />A njia, a ma njiclui di tut populu a Dumnidzãlui nji si deadi aestu har trã dimãndari la pãngãnjlji ayishtearili nipitrumti al Hristos, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />shi s-lji lunjineadzã tuts trã nicuchiripsirea a mistiryiul, tsi eara ascumtu di tu etili di ma nãinti tu Dumnidzãlu tsi adãrã tuti. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Ashãtsi tora, elu vrea prit bisearicã s-fãtsea cunuscuti a pareilor sh-a puterilor tu locurili tsereshti, frunimeatsa di-multi-soi al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Dumnidzãlu u featsi aestã dupã nãetea a lui eternã tsi elu lu mplini tu Hristolu Isus, Domnul a nostru. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Mpriunats tu Hristolu sh-prit pisti tu nãsu noi putem s-nã apruchem a Dumnidzãlui cu libertati sh-cu curaiu. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Vã fac rigeai, s-nu vã dispirats trã munduirili a meali, tsi easti alãvdarea voastrã.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rugãciunea al Pavlu trã Efesienjlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Trã atsea, mini mi ndzinucljedz nãintea a Tãtãlui, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />di la cai ljea numã cathi fumealji tu tser sh-pri loc. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Mini mi rog a Dumnidzãlui, tsi di avearea multu-mãritã a lui s-vã nvãrtusheascã cu fuchii prit Duhlu a lui tu omlu atsel di nãuntru, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />tsi Hristolu s-bãneadzã tu ininjli a voastri prit pisti. Mini mi rog tsi voi s-hits arãdãtsinats sh-thimiljeats tu vreari, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />tsi voi s-putets s-aduchits deadun cu tut populu a Dumnidzãlui tsi easti lãrdzimea, lundzimea, anãltsimea sh-ahãndamea a vreariljei al Hristos, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />shi s-cunushtets vrearea a lui tsi nãstreatsi cunushtearea, tsi voi s-vã mplinits cu tutã mplinãtatea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="EPH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Tora, atsilui tsi dupã putearea tsi lucreadzã tu noi, poati s-fac multu ma multu di cãt noi cãftãm sh-minduim, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />a lui s-lji hibã mãrirea tu bisearicã sh-tu Hristolu Isus pri tuti bãrnurili tu eta a etilor! Amin.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Unitatea a Pistiljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Mini hãpsãnitlu trã Domnul vã rog s-fãtsets unã banã tinjisit trã Domnul tsi vã acljimã. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />S-hits didip aplicats sh-froninji, s-avets arãvdari, s-aprucheats un-alantu cu vreari. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Fãtsets itsi putets tra s-tsãnets unitatea tsi da Duhlu prit pacea tsi vã leagã cu un alantu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Easti un trup sh-un Duh, ashãtsi cum easti unã nãdii la cai Dumnidzãlu vã acljimã. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Easti singur un Domnu, unã pisti, un pitedz, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />un Dumnidzã sh-Tatãl a tutulor, tsi easti pristi tuts, prit tuti sh-tu tuti. <verse eid="EPH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Ma a cathiunui di noi lji si deadi har dupã mizura tsi lji durusi Hristolu. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Trã aestã s-dzãtsi: “Cãndu s-alinã tu anãltsãmi, sclãvusi sclayilji sh-deadi doari a oaminjlor.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Ps 68:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Zborlu “s-alinã” va s-dzãcã cã elu dipunã ma nãinti tu pãrtsili di ma nghios a loclui? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Atsel tsi dipunã easti idyiul atsel tsi s-alinã pristi tuti tserurili, tra s-umplã itsido. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Niscãntsã elu lji featsi apostulji, niscãntsã lji featsi prufits, niscãntsã lji featsi evanghelishtsã, sh-alantsãlji lji featsi picurari sh-nvitsãtori, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />trã etimãsirea a sãmtsãlor trã lucrul a huzmitipsiriljei, trã adrarea a truplui a Hristolui, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />pãnã cãndu s-agiundzem tuts la unitatea a pistiljei sh-la cunushtearea a Hiljilui a Dumnidzãlui. Ashãtsi va nã fãtsem oaminji perfects, agiungãnda mizura a mpliniriljei a Hristolui. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Ashãtsi noi s-nu him ma cilimenji, arucats nclo sh-ncoa dit vãljurili, loat anvãrliga di cathi vimtu a nvitsãturãljei, sh-cu ileili shi shiritlãchili a oaminjlor tsi vor si s-arãd. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Ma dzãcãnda alihea cu vreari, s-crishtem tu tuti cãtrã elu tsi easti caplu, Hristolu. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Elu leagã shi mpriuneadzã tut truplu prit ligãturi sh-cathi mãdular tsi fatsi lucrul a lui, agiutãnda tu crishtearea a truplui prit nvãrtushirea tu vreari.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acljimarea trã Unã Bãnari Sãmtsãtã tu Hristos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Trã atsea ma vã dzãc sh-mãrtirsescu tu Domnul, tsi voi s-nu imnats ma ashãtsi cum imnã pãngãnjlji tu guleatsili a mintilor a lor. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Elji u au mintea scutidisit shi suntu dipãrtsats di bana a Dumnidzãlui trã itia a nishtiriljei a lor sh-trã itia a nchitririljei a ininjilor a lor. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Atselji suntu faptsã nisãmtsãts, s-prideadirã tu disfrãnãri sh-cu zilii nifãntitã tra s-facã itsi lucru lãvushitã. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Ma voi nu lu avets cunuscut ashãtsi Hristolu, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />cãndu dealihea voi avets avdzãt di Isusul shi hits nvitsats di la elu dupã alihea tsi s-afltã tu nãsu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Arucats nclo bãnarea di ma nãinti a omlui atsel vecljiu, tsi s-aspardzi di orixili atseali arali. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Rinoits-vã tu inimã sh-tu mintea a voastrã, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />shi nvishtets omlu atsel noulu faptu dupã Dumnidzãlu tu ndriptatea sh-tu sãmtsãljea tsi yini di alihea.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Trã atsea, alãsats dinãparti arãdearili, cathiunu s-dzãcã alihea cu aproapili a lui, cã noi him mãdulari a truplui a Hristolui. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Nãrits-vã, ma nu amãrtisits! Ascãpitata a soarilui s-nu vã aflã ninga nãrãits. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Nu dats loc a draclui. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Atsel tsi ninga furii, s-nu furã ma, ma ghini s-lucreadzã, fãcãnda lucri buni cu mãnjili a lui, tra s-aibã tsiva trã dari atsilor tsi au ananghi. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />S-nu easã vãrã zbor lãvushitã dit gura a voastra, ma mash zboari buni tra s-agiutã tu crishtearea dupã ananghea, shi s-da har atsilor tsi ascultã. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Nu lu nvirinats Duhlu Sãmtu a Dumnidzãlui, cu cai elu vã vulusi trã dzua a arãscumpãrariljei. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Mutats di voi cathi amãreatsã, nãriri, hulii, ngrãnji, blãstem sh-cathi arãutati. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />S-hits bunji, duruts cu un-alantu, ljirtats un-alantu, ashãtsi di cum Dumnidzãlu vã ari ljirtat prit Hristolu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Urmats urnechea al Dumnidzãu, ca cilimenji multu-vruts, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />sh-imnats tu vreari, ashãtsi cum Hristolu nã vru noi sh-u deadi bana a lui trã noi ca unã doarã njurizmat sh-curbãnsit trã Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="EPH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Ma namisa di voi nu prindi si s-acatsã ngurã putãnsirea, nicurãtsia, icã zilia cã hits oaminji sãmtsã al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Nu prindi s-dzãtsets zboari lãvoasi, glãreshti, nitsi aĝnoasi tsi nu vã tinjiseascã, ma ghini dzãtsets hãristisiri trã Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Sã shtits ghini aestã: nitsi-un curvar, nitsi-un nicurat sh-nitsi-un zilipsearic, cai easti idulatru, nu ari mushtiniri tu amirãriljea a Hristolui sh-a Dumnidzãlui.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Vãrã s-nu vã arãdã cu zboari goali, cã di aesti lucri yini nãrirea a Dumnidzãlui pristi hiljilji a nicãndãrsiriljei. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Trã atsea s-nu hits pãrtashi cu atselji. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Vãrã oara earat scutidi, ma tora hits lunjinã tu Domnul. Bãnats ca hilji a lunjinãljei, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />cã frutlu a lunjinãljei easti tu itsi ghineatsã, ndriptati sh-alihea. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Cilistisits-vã s-aduchits atsea tsi lj-arseashti a Domnului. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Nu loats parti tu faptili nifructoasi a scutidlui, ma di contra s-li vãrghits discljisã. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Lucrili tsi elji li fac pri ascumtu suntu di arushini shi s-li acatsã n'gurã. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Iarã tuti faptili cãndu easã tu lunjinã, s-facã vidzuti itsido tsi s-fãniruseashti easti lunjinã. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Trã atsea Scritura dzãtsi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EPH 5:14" />
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Dishteaptã-ti tini tsi dornji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">shi scoalã-ti dit mortsã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">sh-Hristolu va ti lunjineadzã.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Trã atsea, bãgats mintea cum bãnats, nu ca zurlji, ma ca mintimenji. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Arãscumpãrats chirolu, cã dzãlili suntu arali. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Trã aesta, nu vã fãtsetsi zurlji, ma aduchits cã cai easti vrearea a Domnului. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Nu vã mbitats cu yin, tsi vã dutsi tu disfãrnari, ma umplets-vã cu Duh, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />zburãnda cu un-alantu cu psalnji, imnuri, sh-cãntitsi duhuroasi, cãntãnda sh-alãvdãnda Domnul tu ininjili a voastri, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />hãristisinda totãna Dumnidzãlu Tatãl tu itsido, tu numa a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos. <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Sumbãgats-vã a unui-alantu di frica a Hristolu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mãrtarea sh-Fumeljia Crishtinã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Muljeri, sumbãgats-vã a bãrbatslor a voshtri, ashãtsi di cum a Domnului. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Cã bãrbatlu easti caplu a muljeariljei, ashãtsi di cum Hristolu easti caplu a bisearicãljei sh-elu idyiul easti Ascãpãtorlu a truplui. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Ashãtsi di cum bisearica easti sumbãgatã a Hristolui, tutashã sh-muljerili s-hibã sumbãgati a bãrbatslor a lor tu itsido.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Bãrbats, s-vrets muljerili a voastri, di cum Hristolu vru bisearica sh-u deadi bana a lui trã nãsã, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />tra s-u sãmtseascã shi s-u curã prit aspilarea a apãljei prit zbor, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />shi s-u pãrãstãseascã nãintea a lui bisearica multã-mãritã, fãrã damcã, fãrã sufrã icã fãrã tsiva altã, ma sãmtã sh-fãrã cusuri. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Ashãtsi sh-bãrbatslji prindi s-vor muljerili a lor, di cum vor trupurili a lor. Cai va muljearea a lui, va sinea a lui. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Vãrã nu ari aurãtã vãrã-oarã truplu a lui, ma lu hrãneashti shi s-cãshtigheadzi trã nãsu, ashã di cum s-cãshtigheadzi Hristolu di bisearica, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />cã noi him mãdulari a truplui a lui. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“Trã aestã bãrbatlu va alasã tatãl sh-muma a lui sh-va si-mpriuneadzã cu muljearea a lui, sh-doilji va hibã un trup singur.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Ahr 2:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Mistiryiul aestu easti mari, ma aestã ma u dzãcã trã Hristolu sh-trã bisearica. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Cu tut atsea, cathiunu di voi prindi s-va muljearea a lui ashã di cum s-va elu, tutashã sh-muljearea s-tinjiseascã bãrbatlu a ljei.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Cilimenj, ascultats pãrintsãlji a voshtri tu Domnul, cã aestã easti cu ndriptati. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Tinjisea tatãl a tãu sh-muma a ta,” cai easti dimãndãciunea di prota cu tãxiri, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“tra s-hits ghini shi s-bãnats trã mults-anji pri loc.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ex 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deut 5:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Pãrintsã, s-nu lji nãrits cilimenjlji a voshtri, ma crishtetsilji cu disiplinã sh-cu dimãndãciunjili a Domnului.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sclayilji sh-Nicuchirilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Voi sclayi, ascultats nicuchirlji a voshtri pri loc cu tinjii sh-cu fricã, sh-cu inimã curatã, ashãtsi ca Hristolu, <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />nu huzmitipsits trã videari tra s-lji arsits a oaminjlor, ma ca huzmicheari a Hristolui cai-fac vrearea a Dumnidzãlui cu tutã inimã. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Huzmitipsits cu bunã-vreari, ca a Domnul sh-nu ca a oaminjlor, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />shtinda cã atsel tsi fatsi ghini, cum s-hibã sclav icã liber, va s-ljea arãsplãtirea di la Domnul. <verse eid="EPH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Sh-voi nicuchiri, purtats-vã ghini cu elji sh-nu lã cãnusits, shtinda cã sh-voi sh-sclayilji a voshtri avets idyiul Domnu tu tseruri, cai nu tsãni hãtãrea a vãrui.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Armatura a Dumnidzãlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Tu soni, nvãrtushits-vã tu Domnul sh-cu fuchia a puteariljei a lui. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Nvishtets-vã cu tutã armatura tsi nã da Dumnidzãlu, tra s-putets si stats vãrtoshi contra a murafetsilor a draclui. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Cã noi nu alumtãm contra a truplui sh-a sãndzilui, ma contra a protsilor, contra a autoritãtsilor, contra a domnitorilor aishtei lumi scutidisitã sh-contra a fuchiilor sufliteshti sh-arali tu locurili tsereshti. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Trã atsea loats tutã armatura a Dumnidzãlui, tra s-putets s-ncuntrats dzua atsea araua, shi s-armãnets vãrtoshi dupã tsi s-avets alumtat pãnã tu soni. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Armãnets vãrtoshi shi strindzets mesea cu curaua a alihiljei shi nvishtets ndriptatea ca cheptar. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Ncãlcats-li cicioarili shi s-hits etinji trã dimãndari evanghelu a paciljei, <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />sh-di ma multu, tsãnets pistea ca apãrarea, cu cai putets s-astindzets tuti gilitili focoasi a arãului. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Bãgats helmeta a ascãpariljei shi spata a Duhlui, tsi easti zborlu a Dumnidzãlui.<verse eid="EPH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Rugats-vã cathi oarã tu Duh, prit itsi rugãciuni sh-spigiurari. Trã atsea, stats dishtiptat sh-ipiminisits tu rugãciunjili a voastri trã tut populu a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Rugats-vã sh-trã mini, tsi Dumnidzãlu s-nji da zboarili, tsi s-grescu cu curaiu shi s-fac cunuscut mistiryiul al evanghelu, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />trã cai mini escu ambasador tu prãnghi. Rugats-vã tsi s-dimãndu evanghelu cu curaiu cum prindi.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pitritsearea a Tihicu, Salutãri sh-Ghinicuvintãri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tihicul, fratili a nostru vrut sh-huzmichear pistimen tu Domnul, va s-vã spunã itsido trã mini, tra si shtits cum escu sh-tsi fac. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ma lu pitrec la voi, tra si shtits cum him shi s-vã da diznjirdari a ininjilor a voastri.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Pace a fratsilor sh-a surãrilor, sh-vreari cu pisti di la Dumnidzãlu Tatã sh-di la Domnul Isus Hristos! <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Harul s-hibã cu tuts atselji cai vor Domnul a nostru Isus Hristos cu vreari di daima!<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>